This repository is the mathematical record behind the book:

    "The Crystal and the Clock: How a Single Shape Builds a Universe
     from the Inside"
    by Lee Smart

It holds eight papers, fourteen derivation and reference documents, fifteen
verification scripts (thirteen scored suites totalling 244 itemised checks,
plus two witness scripts), and the hostile machine-referee reports each
paper was hardened against. The book is the plain-language telling; this is
the maths it tells, released so that every claim can be checked without
trusting anyone.

